How to request access to the LP CERT Bot

As a member of the Livermore-Pleasanton CERT program, you can request access to our LPCERT Bot by reaching out via our All Members Telegram group.

In Telegram open the "LP CERT - All Members" group and then type @joe and you will see my username pop-up. Tap my username then type your message requesting access to LPCERT Bot.
I will DM you with the instructions to complete the process.
Once you are connected you can message LPCERT Bot directly and get answers.
